Package: breeze
Version: @DEB_BREEZE_V@
Architecture: @DEB_ARCH@
Maintainer: @DEB_MAINTAINER@
Section: KDE
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://kde.org/
Depends: qt6-base, qt6-declarative, kf6-breeze-icons, kf6-coreaddons, kf6-colorscheme, kf6-config, kf6-configwidgets, kf6-guiaddons, kf6-i18n, kf6-iconthemes, kf6-kcmutils, kf6-kirigami, kf6-windowsystem
Description: Breeze visual style for Xios KDE
 Breeze provides the Qt 6 widget style, color schemes, cursors, and style
 configuration helpers used by Plasma and KDE applications.
 .
 This iOS build keeps the Qt/Wayland visual style path and defers KWin window
 decorations until the compositor decoration path is enabled.
